&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the broader open-source AI tooling landscape — including MCP servers, model serving frameworks, or agentic systems — and the curiosity to keep up with a fast-moving space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in DevOps, platform engineering, or infrastructure automation, with comfort building reproducible test environments at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
