&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;Deep experience in a customer-facing technical role, such as Solutions Engineering, within enterprise organizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;Proven ability to simplify and tailor complex technical messaging for technical, management, and executive audiences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;Strong capability to translate technology features into business impact to support value realization conversations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;Professional-level English communication skills, both written and verbal&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
