&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of cross-functional leadership experience, ideally driving IT operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on ownership of multi-million dollar IT budgets at the P&amp;amp;L or cost center level, utilizing financial systems like Coupa, Netsuite, and Adaptive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a large SaaS portfolio - Vendor negotiation experience yielding measurable cost savings, and leading rationalization initiatives at a publicly traded company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated leadership in owning SOX controls (ITGC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence with experience presenting to VP, SVP, and CIO stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
