&lt;li&gt;M&amp;amp;A SaaS integration experience with a history of rationalizing acquired tech stacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Snowflake or Tableau for self-serve financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
