&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;Perform detailed log, telemetry, and packet-level analysis to identify the root cause, reproducing complex defects, providing engineering-ready bug reports, and validating fixes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
