&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;Analyze Monthly/Quarterly GTM performance, focusing on New Business ACV, Upsell/Cross-sell, Pipeline health, and coverage ratio while providing variance analysis of actual bookings vs. forecast&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage HC &amp;amp; Expense reporting and forecasting, including Marketing spend, Travel &amp;amp; Expense, and Program Spend, along with variance commentaries and walks&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;Support the annual planning process and rolling quarterly forecasts by building and maintaining financial models to predict productivity and consolidate regional inputs for US leadership&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply preliminary AI/ML tools to automate routine reporting and leverage Generative AI to synthesize large datasets and draft executive summaries&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner effectively with US-based GTM Operations and Global FP&amp;amp;A teams, maintaining the flexibility to overlap with US PST time zones for key forecast calls and business reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
