&lt;p&gt;As the Legal Operations Manager, Commercial, you will be responsible for the systems, processes, and workflows that drive our commercial legal function. You will partner with the Director of Legal Operations on commercial operations strategy while working day-to-day with the Legal, IT, and GTM teams to make cross-functional workflows faster, more consistent, and easier to work with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Zscaler’s CLM tools, including workflow design, template management, repository hygiene, reporting, integrations, and ongoing optimization&lt;/li&gt;
