&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop marketing strategy in sync with local business and global priorities by partnering with sales, SDRs, and cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run quarterly field marketing activities from awareness to demand generation to hit KPIs including pipe progression and marketing-sourced pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy always-on digital marketing for top-funnel coverage and run account-centric programs for deeper penetration into larger accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the field marketing budget and co-op funds while driving measurable results against goals for MQLs and meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with CoE teams to scale marketing execution in India across communications, customer advocacy, and CXO programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
