&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6–12 years of in-country field marketing experience across both direct and partner-led channels with proven results in pipeline growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in digital and omni-channel marketing including ABM, social, SEM, and community marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with the ability to derive actionable business insights from data to drive smart decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Salesforce, Google Suite, and AI productivity tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
