&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;Exceptional technical sales expertise combined with the communication skills necessary to engage effectively with sophisticated enterprise customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;Subject matter expertise in Data Security Posture Management (DSPM), Data Security, or cloud security projects like CNAPP&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to create and deliver high-impact Proof of Concept presentations that clearly communicate complex technical value to a business audience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
