&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Familiarity with or a strong aptitude for working with Network File shares within Data Center environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;Hands-on familiarity or the ability to quickly master Gen AI infrastructure platforms including AWS Bedrock, Azure AI Foundry, or Google Vertex&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
