&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualified lawyer with a valid license to practice in a UK or EU jurisdiction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in a corporate legal department or law firm advising on data privacy issues, including negotiating contracts and product counseling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert knowledge of international privacy laws and regulations with experience providing guidance to global teams&lt;/li&gt;
