&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a Salesforce CPQ SME, with strong understanding of SKU/quote configuration, SKU migration mapping, quote structuring, and relevant corporate/financial/sales policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain operational relationships across your coverage area; partner with leadership to drive global best practices across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure policy-compliant quoting, including reviewing and granting SKU use-case exceptions only in line with business policy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve quoting issues end-to-end: troubleshoot operational quoting problems, understand contract/subscription data impacts, and escalate for support when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UAT new quote processes/system enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
