&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Regional Director to join our Sales and Go-to-Market team. This is a hybrid role based in Switzerland, reporting to the Regional Vice President. The Zscaler Sales and Go-to-Market team is a global group of professionals passionate about delighting our customers, nurturing trusted partnerships, and driving a secure, cloud-enabled digital future. In this role, you will lead your team to demonstrate the power and agility of cloud transformation and further cement our position as the world leader in cloud security.&lt;/p&gt;
