&lt;li&gt;Act as the executive sponsor for key partners to create joint plans, generate pipeline and drive opportunities to closure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
