&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Pipeline Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Research and prospect into organizations via email, calling, networking, and creative outreach to build early-stage sales pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Qualification:&lt;/strong&gt; Penetrate, profile, and qualify targeted companies to schedule well-qualified appointments with key decision-makers.&lt;/p&gt;
