&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Market Research:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify key decision-makers, educate prospects on Zscaler’s value proposition, and qualify buying interest through deep customer research.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
