&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Reporting Structure:&lt;/strong&gt; Reporting to the Sales Development Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
