&lt;li&gt;Initiate conversations with CXOs and cybersecurity leaders to explore their projects and priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule qualified meetings with decision-makers to advance sales opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate Zscaler’s Zero Trust value proposition and handle objections with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
