&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;Senior Sales Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Americas Field Sales team as an individual contributor. In this role, you will be a critical technical partner to our Enterprise sales organization, serving as the bridge between complex technical solutions and meaningful business outcomes. While this is a remote position based in Alberta, you will play a hands-on role in the field, with occasional travel to customer sites and internal events to drive regional success.&lt;/p&gt;
