&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a seasoned Senior Tax Manager to join our Tax department. This role is based in our San Jose, CA headquarters (in office Tuesday-Thursday) or remotely across the US, reporting to the Senior Director, Tax. You will be responsible for leading Zscaler&#39;s North America income tax compliance process along with supporting the quarterly and annual global tax provision process. You will be heavily involved in shaping the tax department’s tax compliance policies and processes, while supporting the business needs of a fast-growing company. This is an individual contributor role with oversight responsibilities for local and remote team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and review the US and Canada income tax compliance including the U.S. federal, state and local income tax returns and estimated taxes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and review the monthly and quarterly U.S. indirect tax compliance including sales tax, use tax, gross receipts tax and property tax&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the R&amp;amp;D tax credit and SRED credit studies with the support of external service providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with the Company’s ASC 740 income tax provision for interim and annual income tax provisions, as reported in the Company’s SEC Form 10-K/10-Q filings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build cross functional relationships with the broader finance organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
