&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage operational tasks for products in US Government classified environments, including deployments, on-call duties, and incident management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scripts, containerized services, and monitoring mechanisms to automate operations tasks and ensure minimal service disruption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create operations documentation and implement measures to prevent recurring incidents while contributing to DevOps best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and enhance Zscaler services within classified environments, ensuring 24x7 coverage including night and holiday shifts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
