&lt;li&gt;You seek out challenges because you are energized by finding solutions, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are customer-obsessed, championing their needs from start to finish because their success is our success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are driven by innovation, believing in the power of technology to accelerate transformation and always looking for a better, more secure, and scalable way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience on Unix/Linux platforms, with strong proficiency in C/C++, Python or Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in Unix/Linux Operating System internals and command-line utilities to build, debug, and optimize high-performance services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of distributed systems and experience building scalable systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in advanced data structures and algorithms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Ansible for automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, or Azure) and virtualization technologies like Nutanix or KVM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
