&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience with strong understanding of IT systems, development, and DevOps concepts including APIs, CI/CD, containers, and cloud basics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience with cybersecurity concepts, specifically vulnerability management, exposure management, and threat management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with data analysis, data modeling, and SQL with the ability to troubleshoot data issues end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
