&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot;&gt;Manage operational tasks for products in US Government classified environments, including deployments, on-call duties, and incident management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot;&gt;Oversee cloud infrastructure components across AWS, private cloud environments, containers, and VMs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot;&gt;Develop scripts, containerized services, and monitoring mechanisms to automate operations tasks and ensure minimal service disruption&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;Create operations documentation and implement measures to prevent recurring incidents while contributing to DevOps best practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot;&gt;Build and enhance Zscaler services within classified environments, ensuring 24x7 coverage including night and holiday shifts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
