&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge and professional experience with the C++ language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of network protocols and experience with socket programming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in the Linux ecosystem with a comprehensive understanding of Linux system architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to learn and work across multiple platforms including Windows, Mac, iOS, and Android&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience writing easily-testable and thoroughly-tested code using abstractions like dependency injection&lt;/li&gt;
