&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot;&gt;Deliver management-level visibility and reporting on project status, risks, and information to ensure transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;Develop and refine processes, program templates, and documentation to scale the organization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot;&gt;Coordinate cross-functional communication between system engineers, sales, and product teams to deliver an excellent customer experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
