&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience in threat hunting, incident response, security operations, malware analysis, or network defense&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;Practical experience using SIEM tools such as Splunk, Microsoft Sentinel, or ElasticSearch&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;Deep familiarity with the MITRE ATT&amp;amp;CK framework and modern Tactics, Techniques, and Procedures (TTPs)&lt;/p&gt;
