&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;Proven ability to analyze adversary behavior and malware campaigns to translate findings into detection logic&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s or graduate degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related discipline, or equivalent security industry experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
