&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Advanced scripting and automation skills, specifically using Python&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;Expertise in writing IDS/IPS and YARA signatures for network-based threat detection&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
