&lt;li&gt;Experience driving the implementation of large-scale programs, facilitating cross-team collaboration, and managing the deployment lifecycle to inspire successful adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional stakeholder management skills with a proven ability to use data and employee feedback to influence senior leaders and build scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
