&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience&amp;nbsp; product feature implementations, and best-practice adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with operating systems such as Linux, Unix, and Free BSD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience troubleshooting network issues and familiarity with the necessary tools. (Ping, Traceroute, MTR)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of protocols such as HTTP, SMTP, FTP, and DNS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
