&lt;li&gt;You operate with urgency. You understand that in a high-growth environment, speed and quality are not mutually exclusive. You have a relentless focus on execution and a bias for action, delivering high-impact results quickly to win for the customer and the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive related experience in enterprise architecture, networking, or security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of enterprise architecture combined with advanced working knowledge of networking or security, coupled with a mid-level understanding of the data protection and security operations segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with the ability to pivot and control conversations during meetings to achieve desired outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven skill in building long-term, trusted relationships with key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
