&lt;p&gt;Zscaler accelerates digital transformation to ensure our customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. As an &lt;strong&gt;AI-forward enterprise&lt;/strong&gt;, we are constantly pushing the envelope, leveraging the world’s largest security data lake to power our cloud-native Zero Trust Exchange platform. This innovation protects our customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here, &lt;strong&gt;impact in your role matters more than title&lt;/strong&gt; and trust is built on results. We say, impact over activity. We seek innovators who actively use AI to amplify their impact and who thrive in an environment where we leverage intelligent systems to stay ahead of evolving threats. We believe in transparency and value &lt;strong&gt;constructive, honest debate&lt;/strong&gt;—we’re focused on getting to the best ideas, faster. We build high-performing teams that can make an impact quickly and with high quality. To do this, we are building a culture of execution centered on &lt;strong&gt;customer obsession&lt;/strong&gt;, collaboration, ownership, and accountability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value high-impact, high-accountability with a sense of urgency where you’re enabled to do your best work and embrace your potential. If you’re driven by purpose, thrive on solving complex challenges, and want to be part of the team that’s helping to secure the AI age, we invite you to bring your talents to Zscaler and help shape the future of cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Workplace Experience Specialist to join our Facilities &amp;amp; Workplace Services – Bangalore, India team. This is an on-site role based in Zscaler Bangalore - Bagmane / Bren Optimus, reporting to the Workplace Experience Manager..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Workplace Experience Specialist will be the heartbeat of our Bangalore office, ensuring seamless daily operations and a world-class environment for our employees. You will manage vendor relationships, oversee facility maintenance, and drive initiatives that enhance employee engagement and workplace safety.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process Leadership: Act as the India &amp;amp; APJ Process Owner for the ServiceNow WSD module, managing regional ticketing workflows and leveraging data-driven analytics to optimize workplace service delivery and resource allocation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Total Workplace Portfolio Governance: Oversee daily operations across a diverse real estate portfolio, including conventional leased offices and managed flexible spaces, ensuring a unified Zscaler brand experience, robust maintenance (AMCs), and 98%+ SLA compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-End Mobility &amp;amp; Operational Safety: Direct the corporate transportation strategy and daily operations while leading safety protocols (ERT/EHS) and statutory compliance (CLRA), ensuring a 100% secure environment and 99%+ on-time commute performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workplace Amenities &amp;amp; Experience Management: Direct the end-to-end delivery of premium F&amp;amp;B services, employee-centric events, and space optimization strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Partnership &amp;amp; Fiscal Stewardship: Collaborate with leadership, procurement, and finance to manage the full vendor lifecycle, tracking KPIs and implementing process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build deep empathy for the customer—both internal and external—and anchor your decisions in solving their real-world problems. You champion their needs from start to finish, knowing their success is our success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You seek out challenges because you are energized by finding solutions, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. You adapt to what’s needed, navigating seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand that in a high-growth environment, speed and quality are not mutually exclusive. You have a relentless focus on execution and a bias for action, delivering high-impact results quickly to win for the customer and the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years Facilities/Workplace experience managing large, high-density IT/Tech sites (2,000–3,000+ headcount)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ServiceNow WSD/WSM (or similar) regional lead for India &amp;amp; APJ driving data-led efficiency, workflows, and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong IFM/Soft Services governance delivering premium F&amp;amp;B, Housekeeping, Concierge; always 100% audit-ready&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end corporate transport: fleet, routes, and safety/compliance for large-scale mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bangalore statutory expertise (CLRA, EHS, ERT) with strong cross-functional stakeholder management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a global MNC or a high-growth tech company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-Geographic Exposure: Experience working with stakeholders across different time zones or managing remote facility leads in the INDIA &amp;amp; APJ region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ServiceNow Mastery: Advanced experience in WSM module customization and data-driven reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
